## API Routes

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| POST | `/api/auth/register` | Register new student |
| POST | `/api/auth/login` | Login, returns JWT |
| GET | `/api/auth/me` | Get current user profile |
| POST | `/api/documents/upload` | Upload document (PDF/DOCX/PPTX/TXT) |
| GET | `/api/documents` | List user's documents |
| GET | `/api/documents/:id` | Get document details |
| DELETE | `/api/documents/:id` | Delete document |
| POST | `/api/ai/summarize/:doc_id` | Generate summary for document |
| GET | `/api/ai/summary/:doc_id` | Get existing summary |
| POST | `/api/flashcards/generate/:doc_id` | Generate flashcards from document |
| GET | `/api/flashcards` | Get all flashcards (with filters) |
| GET | `/api/flashcards/due` | Get due flashcards for review |
| PUT | `/api/flashcards/:id/review` | Submit SRS review rating |
| POST | `/api/quizzes/generate/:doc_id` | Generate quiz from document |
| GET | `/api/quizzes` | List all quizzes |
| GET | `/api/quizzes/:id` | Get quiz with questions |
| POST | `/api/quizzes/:id/attempt` | Submit quiz attempt |
| GET | `/api/quizzes/:id/results/:attempt_id` | Get quiz results + weak topics |
| POST | `/api/chat/message` | Send message to AI tutor |
| GET | `/api/chat/sessions` | List chat sessions |
| GET | `/api/chat/sessions/:id` | Get chat session history |
| GET | `/api/analytics/overview` | Get dashboard analytics |
| GET | `/api/analytics/progress` | Get progress timeline |

