## Build Order

| Step | Feature | Backend | Frontend | Priority |
|------|---------|---------|----------|----------|
| 1 | Auth + Dashboard Shell | User model, Auth routes, JWT | Login, Register, Dashboard layout | 🔴 Critical |
| 2 | File Upload + Parsing | Upload route, Document parser | Upload UI, Notes list | 🔴 Critical |
| 3 | Embeddings + Vector DB | ChromaDB setup, Embedding service | — | 🔴 Critical |
| 4 | AI Summaries | Summary chain, Summary routes | Summary view | 🔴 Critical |
| 5 | Flashcards + SRS | Flashcard model, SM-2 logic | Flashcard review UI | 🟡 High |
| 6 | Quiz Engine | Quiz generation, Grading | Quiz attempt UI | 🟡 High |
| 7 | Weak Topic Analysis | Analysis service | Results + weak topics UI | 🟡 High |
| 8 | AI Tutor Chat | RAG chat chain | Chat interface | 🟢 Medium |
| 9 | Analytics + Polish | Analytics aggregation | Charts, progress views | 🟢 Medium |

## Key Design Decisions

1. **Gemini as default LLM** — Using `langchain-google-genai` with Gemini embeddings and chat models. Switchable to OpenAI/Ollama via env var.
2. **ChromaDB for vectors** — Lightweight, file-based, no separate server needed for MVP.
3. **SM-2 Algorithm** — Proven spaced repetition algorithm (same as Anki).
4. **Synchronous AI calls for MVP** — No Celery/RQ initially; will add for scaling.
5. **Context API over Redux** — Simpler state management for MVP scope.
6. **Vite over CRA** — Faster dev server and builds.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This plan focuses exclusively on the **student-facing MVP**. Teacher dashboards, classroom features, and college analytics are deferred to Phase 2+.
